{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#card-zh","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 是面向 DSH Web 的本地 API 花费统计命令，通过注册 /usage 读取本机 LiteLLM gateway_usage.jsonl 落账记录，按模型和日期汇总 token 与估算费用。它区分缓存命中、未命中和输出 token，支持按小时查看，并按 locale 和时区展示当地币种；DeepSeek 峰谷规则按北京时间计算。可输入 today、yesterday、月日或 all，并可扩展模型价格、套餐池和别名映射。适合需要查看本地网关模型调用账单的 DSH 用户；需提供网关日志路径或使用自动探测。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:492-504","lib/index.js:358-482","lib/index.js:289-336"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#card-en","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"luxueliu-usage-command adds /usage to DSH Web. It reads a local gateway log and summarizes model token use and estimated costs by date, with hourly detail and cache categories. Query today, yesterday, a date, or all. Currency follows locale; custom model prices and aliases are supported.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:492-504","lib/index.js:358-482","lib/index.js:289-336"]}
