{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#feature-1","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 的功能「模型费用汇总」：输入 /usage、today、yesterday、MM-DD 或 all，命令按日期和模型汇总缓存命中、未命中、输出 token 与估算费用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:358-428"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#feature-2","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 的功能「分小时明细」：查询单日时，报表按模型列出每小时 token 用量和费用；DeepSeek 模型还显示峰谷标记及新旧价格口径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:445-471"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#feature-3","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 的功能「本地币种与时区」：报表根据系统 locale 和时区确定显示币种及日期小时，也可通过配置覆盖；DeepSeek 峰谷按 Asia/Shanghai 计算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:129-149","lib/index.js:237-253"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#feature-4","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 的功能「自定义模型与别名」：在配置中添加官方直连价格、中转模型价格或套餐池，并把日志模型名映射到别名；未知模型只统计 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:158-207","lib/index.js:397-418"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#feature-5","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 的功能「读取网关落账」：命令读取指定或自动探测的 gateway_usage.jsonl，筛除无效记录、拆分缓存 token 并去重；可限制读取文件末尾字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:289-336"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#caveat-1","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 使用本机网关落账文件统计；未经过该网关的直连调用不在报表范围内，因此统计结果不等同于账户的完整账单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:475-481"]}
{"unit_id":"luxueliu__luxueliu-usage-command#caveat-2","repo":"luxueliu/luxueliu-usage-command","commit":"41fbc5e80b178697b7a1d4aa2b50cf647a665858","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"luxueliu-usage-command 可配置将调试信息追加到用户目录下的 ~/.dsh/luxueliu-usage-command.log；默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:485-489","lib/index.js:24"]}
